[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_TRANSPORT]
Applewood Traffic Network

[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_TRANSPORT_desc]
To get rich, build roads first.\nA traffic network with sufficient capacity is like blood vessels, continuously delivering nutrients to the heart - the new city under construction in Applewood.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_TRANSPORT]
苹果坞交通网

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_TRANSPORT_desc]
要致富，先修路。\n运力足够的交通网就像是血管，将营养源源不断地输送到心脏——正在苹果坞建设的新城。

